Bestiary: {
	MossbackBeetle: The thick moss on its shell hides flecks of Verdigris.
	LanternMoth: Its warm eyes look like tiny lanterns from across the cave.
	GlassCrawler: Glass plates shield this crawler as it searches the Reach.
	GlasswingMoth: Its wings catch the light of forgotten rune lanterns.
}

