Keybinds.Spellbook.DisplayName: "Open Nyuu Spellbook"
Items.AetherloomWand.Tooltip: "K: choose a learned spell in the Spellbook\nLeft-click to cast; hold right-click for Crescent Ward\nHold left-click with Emberbloom to charge a larger burst"
Items.EmberbloomTome.Tooltip: "Permanently learn Emberbloom for this character\nHold the Aetherloom Wand to charge a fiery rune burst"
Items.FrostbloomTome.Tooltip: "Permanently learn Frostbloom for this character\nPiercing ice; unlock a three-shot fan at mastery 5"
Items.TideglassTome.Tooltip: "Permanently learn Tideglass for this character\nWater orbs split on impact and leave enemies Wet"
Items.DawnmendTome.Tooltip: "Permanently learn Dawnmend for this character\nA self-healing spell with an eight-second cooldown"
Items.StormglassTome.Tooltip: "Permanently learn Stormglass Fork for this character\nLightning jumps to nearby enemies; wet targets take stronger chain hits"
Items.NyuuSpellbook.Tooltip: "Open the Spellbook to select spells and track mastery\nK also opens it without carrying this book"
Items.WardSigil.Tooltip: "20 increased maximum mana\nHalves the continuing mana cost of Crescent Ward\nEquip in a normal accessory slot"
